#: ../../src/design.rst:5
msgid "Design overview"
msgstr "设计概览"

#: ../../src/design.rst:7
msgid ""
"libuv is cross-platform support library which was originally written for "
"`Node.js`_. It's designed around the event-driven asynchronous I/O model."
msgstr ""
"libuv 是一个跨平台支持库，最初为 `Node.js`_ 编写。它围绕事件驱动的异步"
" I/O 模型设计。"

#: ../../src/design.rst:12
msgid ""
"The library provides much more than a simple abstraction over different "
"I/O polling mechanisms: 'handles' and 'streams' provide a high level "
"abstraction for sockets and other entities; cross-platform file I/O and "
"threading functionality is also provided, amongst other things."
msgstr ""
"该库提供的远不止对不同 I/O 轮询机制的简单抽象：“句柄”和“流”为套接字及其"
"他实体提供了高层抽象；除此之外，还提供跨平台文件 I/O 和线程等功能。"

